stateDiagram-v2
    note left of booked
        booking.state values.
        A booking auto-ends (-> done) when its
        window (endTime) passes, whatever state
        it's in. No "overstay"/"expired" states:
        a car still there after endTime is just
        the stall "overstay" flag (only violation
        possible — flap blocks unbooked parking).
    end note

    [*] --> booked : POST /book

    booked --> active : POST /open (driver arrives)
    booked --> cancelled : POST /cancel (before use)
    booked --> done : endTime passes (never used)

    active --> done : endTime passes (auto-end; no /close)

    done --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
